Fix (commit fa87dc8 "Merge branch 'manus-parity' into khamis1992/cc-c17 (C17)"):
- package.json: kept BOTH eval:coding-bench (C17) and eval:design / eval:coding-prompt (parity).
- src/agent/loop.ts: kept BOTH the C17 coding router (chatWithCodingRouter +
  createProviderClient/cooldownStore/env/onCodingRoute seams) AND parity's per-run
  opts.model override for the quick-edit route. An explicit per-run model wins over
  cfg.model; a coding turn still replaces it with the strongest coder in the chain.
- src/scripts/check-test-isolation.ts: fixed TS18046 "error is of type unknown" that
  the merge introduced (cast the execFileSync rejection before reading status/stdout/stderr).

git merge-tree --write-tree manus-parity HEAD exits 0, so no conflict re-emerges.

